  "description": "Saintess Serylta is tasked by God to marry the crown prince and continue the holy bloodline within the empire. Just before her wedding, a mysterious client hires two incubi to sabotage her divine mission. But Serylta is hardly a pure worker of God in the bedroom, as she quickly dominates them both with her “holy powers,” turning them into her submissive pets. And obeying their new master, the incubi reveal the perverted truth behind the scumbag who hired them...! \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
